    "updated_at": "2021-07-15T19:09:13Z",
    "body": "Alright, the Streams spec PR is merged, and this is rebased and should be up to date. We'll need some time for the terms to make their way into databases, but hopefully then the build should pass.\r\n\r\nIt's still not 100% clear to me whether we should merge this or wait for it to get on the near-term implementation roadmap first; that's up to the editors. But I think it's been a very valuable exercise in designing Streams's other-spec integration points so it's time well spent for me :)",
