    "body": "I'm very excited to get this shipped but we should hold off on merging until there's at least a timeline for getting it into a Chromium release. Right now that's being tracked as [issue 1182905](https://crbug.com/1182905) and is blocked on changes to the Streams C++ bindings to support natively implemented BYOB streams.",
